5-CANARY DEPLOYMENT?
⚙️ How It Works (Step-by-Step):
Deploy the new version alongside the old version.
Route a small percentage of traffic (e.g., 5%) to the new version.
Monitor performance, errors, and logs.
If stable, increase traffic gradually (10% → 50% → 100%).
Finally, retire the old version.
🏗️ Used In:
Kubernetes (K8s) — using tools like Argo Rollouts or Flagger
AWS — using CodeDeploy with load balancers
Jenkins, Spinnaker, GitLab CI/CD pipelines



