2. Upgrade addons: VPC-CNI, CoreDNS, kube-proxy
3. Create new Launch Template with new EKS-optimized AMI
4. Apply new LT to ASG
5. Rolling upgrade worker nodes:
     drain → terminate → ASG creates new upgraded node
6. Validate workloads + nodes

